# ── AI Chat — Provider configuration ─────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Provider priority: Groq → NVIDIA → HuggingFace
# Widget is hidden entirely when no token is set (graceful degradation).
#
# ── PRIMARY: Groq (free, recommended) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Fast, always-warm, real SSE streaming, CORS-friendly.
# Get a free key at https://console.groq.com → API Keys (no credit card).
# Free tier: 14,400 req/day, 30 req/min.
VITE_GROQ_TOKEN=

# Optional model override (default: qwen/qwen3.8-27b)
# VITE_GROQ_MODEL=qwen/qwen3.8-27b

# ── BACKUP: NVIDIA NIM (free credits) ───────────────────────────────────────
# OpenAI-compatible, real SSE streaming, 1000 free credits at signup.
# Get a key at https://build.nvidia.com → API Keys (no credit card).
# Default model: nemotron-3.5-lightning-30b-a3b (fast, clean chat with thinking disabled)
VITE_NVIDIA_TOKEN=

# Optional model override (default: nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning-30b-a3b)
# Alternatives: nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b, nvidia/nemotron-4-340b-instruct
# VITE_NVIDIA_MODEL=nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning-30b-a3b

# ── FALLBACK: Hugging Face (requires credits or PRO) ────────────────────────
# Uses the HF Inference Providers router. Free $0.10 monthly credit depletes fast.
# Add credits at https://huggingface.co/settings/billing or subscribe to PRO.
# NOTE: Mistral models are NOT available on the HF router.
VITE_HF_TOKEN=

# Optional model override (default: Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B)
# VITE_HF_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B
